registry data in the same region: only 21% of the persons on the cancer registry reported occurrence of cancer. Breast cancer was found to be most frequently accurately reported.</p></abstract></article-meta></front><body><supplementary-material content-type="scanned-pages"><graphic xlink:href="brjcancer00180-0139.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="445" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="brjcancer00180-0140.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="446" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="brjcancer00180-0141.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="447" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/></supplementary-material></body></article>